dance Flicker
// The kicks push the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the snares set how fast it spins and the
// snares turn it; drops in the bass reverse it; drops in the snares switch its flat spin on and
// off.
// Inspired by strobal, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.bass_hit speed 1.7 settle 0.01
zoom follows music.mid_hit amount 0.5 settle 0.48
spin follows music.mid_hit from 0 to 493 smooth 0.15
turn on music.mid_hit changes by 0.61
reverse on music.bass drops by 0.66 on 12 off 4
flat on music.mid_hit drops by 0.86 on 100 off 0
